  "limits": [
    "Measurements are from this machine and controlled windows, not a universal latency SLA.",
    "The observed seconds-long stall is in opening/registration. Steady rendering in this workload is around 1ms.",
    "Batching alone still leaves roughly 0.2-0.3 seconds for one global style pass; it is diagnostic proof, not the final production fix."
  ]
